Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: USB host on all three USB-C ports
 (linux-aurora j714s3-10)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-10 carries the rest of edimoldovan's
J714c USB series: SuperSpeed on port 1, the Type-C controllers, the USB 2.0
re-arm. From betizzel/omarchy-m5 (b8870743).
